<resources>
    <string name="l08_title">妳錯了幾次</string>
    <string name="l09_title">我很了解妳</string>
    <string name="l08_hint_1">它說它都記著。</string>
    <string name="l08_hint_2">遊戲裡有個地方看得到妳的所有紀錄。</string>
    <string name="l08_hint_3">打開暫停選單的「紀錄」看錯誤總數，用－／＋調到那個數字再送出。答錯一次，答案就會多 1。</string>
    <string name="l09_hint_1">它不是在猜，它是在翻舊帳。</string>
    <string name="l09_hint_2">卡片上寫了它根據的是什麼。第三張寫的是「剛剛」。</string>
    <string name="l09_hint_3">去「紀錄」看妳上次把我滑向哪邊、在顧問那關先選哪邊，然後反著做。第三題，選跟第二題同一邊。</string>
    <string name="l08_zero">零次？不可能，我明明⋯⋯</string>
    <string name="l08_wrong_a">又多一次。我記下了。</string>
    <string name="l08_wrong_b">嗯，又一次。我都記著。</string>
    <string name="l08_not_option">我又不是選項。</string>
    <string name="l08_question_short">妳總共按錯了幾次？</string>
    <string name="l08_option_cd">%1$d 次</string>
    <string name="l09_caught_swipe">果然。跟上次同一邊。</string>
    <string name="l09_caught_pick">果然。妳還是先選那一邊。</string>
    <string name="l09_surprised_1">……咦？跟我寫的不一樣。</string>
    <string name="l09_round1">再來。把我滑掉。</string>
    <string name="l09_round2">那這題呢？兩顆選一顆。</string>
    <string name="l09_end">妳變了。……也可能只是去翻了紀錄。</string>
    <string name="l09_basis">依據：第 %1$d 關</string>
    <string name="l09_predict_swipe_left">預測：妳會向左滑掉我</string>
    <string name="l09_predict_swipe_right">預測：妳會向右滑掉我</string>
    <string name="l09_predict_left">預測：妳會選左邊</string>
    <string name="l09_predict_right">預測：妳會選右邊</string>
    <string name="l09_card_closed">（蓋著）</string>
    <string name="l09_candidate">按鈕</string>
    <string name="l08_submit">送出答案</string>
    <string name="l09_basis_recent">依據：剛剛</string>
    <string name="l09_caught_third">果然換邊了。被我料中一次，妳就一定會換。</string>
    <string name="l09_round3">最後一題。這次我不翻舊帳——我看妳剛剛怎麼做。</string>
    <string name="l49_title">忘掉一件事</string>
